            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is within the normal range, indicating no evidence of CD4+ lymphopenia. From a laboratory perspective, there are no abnormalities detected in this result. Clinical correlation is recommended if immunodeficiency or other immune-related conditions are suspected.</td></tr></table></div>"
